{"2127470": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Lost in the Sand", "steam_appid": 2127470, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slow-paced shooter with strategy elements set in a procedural, fully destructible, post-apocalyptic world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft and fight with DIY weapons, build and demolish oil camps, meet silly characters, manage and upgrade your army, in order to beat The Vultures and discover what's behind The Sandstorm.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>UNRAVEL THE MYSTERY!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2127470/extras/d2966187c4f291d2de4e473a301cd79a.poster.avif?t=1783702231\" width=612 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2127470/extras/d2966187c4f291d2de4e473a301cd79a.webm?t=1783702231\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2127470/extras/d2966187c4f291d2de4e473a301cd79a.mp4?t=1783702231\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet silly characters and unravel the story about the world, and about Axel's past. What kind of mystery is behind The Sandstorm? What happened to Axel?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BUILD OIL EXTRACTION CAMPS!</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2127470/extras/bf0d72e81a5e03705ae32613ad74f879.poster.avif?t=1783702231\" width=612 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2127470/extras/bf0d72e81a5e03705ae32613ad74f879.webm?t=1783702231\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2127470/extras/bf0d72e81a5e03705ae32613ad74f879.mp4?t=1783702231\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build oil extraction camps for gathering and defending the main resource in the game, oil. Fortify them with defensive structures, static weapons, and defenders, in order to fend off Vulture attacks!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DESTROY THE ENVIRONMENT!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2127470/extras/5681342ce469d32be5dd8932b25f4dab.poster.avif?t=1783702231\" width=612 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2127470/extras/5681342ce469d32be5dd8932b25f4dab.webm?t=1783702231\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2127470/extras/5681342ce469d32be5dd8932b25f4dab.mp4?t=1783702231\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lost in the Sand features structures with physics-based destruction that you can use to your tactical advantage. Either you use it to create improvised escape routes, demolish enemy's defensive structures or simply blow up stuff for fun. You are not safe anywhere on the map!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CRAFT EQUIPMENT AND VEHICLES!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2127470/extras/105101842bb6e1b85bb6c112430e49c8.poster.avif?t=1783702231\" width=612 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2127470/extras/105101842bb6e1b85bb6c112430e49c8.webm?t=1783702231\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2127470/extras/105101842bb6e1b85bb6c112430e49c8.mp4?t=1783702231\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >  </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft equipment such as weapons and armor in order to gain an advantage over your opponent. Assemble vehicles and upgrade them with armor, weapons or performance upgrades to make a real difference on the battlefield.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MANAGE AN ARMY!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2127470/extras/6c36c92ba946acf5152c46986f26d27f.avif?t=1783702231\" width=616 height=180 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recruit volunteers, create and save loadouts, manage camp garrisons, manage their resources, give orders, build and upgrade squads and watch them do the hard work for you!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CONFIRM YOUR KILLS!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2127470/extras/0495207078da945ca2e9eae4dcb5c4c5.poster.avif?t=1783702231\" width=612 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2127470/extras/0495207078da945ca2e9eae4dcb5c4c5.webm?t=1783702231\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2127470/extras/0495207078da945ca2e9eae4dcb5c4c5.mp4?t=1783702231\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >NPCs are active ragdolls, shoot them, explode them or hit them with a car and they will react to physics forces.  Their health is built on a semi-realistic injury reaction system rather than a traditional health bar. You can never be too sure if enemies are fully eliminated or just knocked out! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >NPCs behavior is influenced by a range of factors such as: </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Bleeding (Affects health and consciousness)  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Consciousness (Affects clumsiness of their actions)  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Health (Affects consciousness)  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Limb strength (Makes individual limbs behave clumsier)  </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Morale (Makes them use more offensive or defensive tactics)   </p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ENHANCE YOUR PERFORMANCE!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2127470/extras/b2d606aa50ebde142df7813a5534c11f.avif?t=1783702231\" width=616 height=180 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take very suspicious substances made by The Cook in order to enhance your combat capabilities. Some improve your aim, some make you more durable, some make you bleed less, but all of them give you side effects.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURE LIST:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story &amp; characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crafting weapons, armor, ammo</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Building oil extraction camps</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Destruction system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vehicles crafting, driving and upgrading</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Army commanding</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trading with NPCs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Active ragdolls (Injury reaction system)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Procedurally generated worlds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stimulants</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slow-paced shooter with strategy elements set in a procedural, fully destructible, post-apocalyptic world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft and fight with DIY weapons, build and demolish oil camps, meet silly characters, manage and upgrade your army, in order to beat The Vultures and discover what's behind The Sandstorm.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>UNRAVEL THE MYSTERY!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2127470/extras/d2966187c4f291d2de4e473a301cd79a.poster.avif?t=1783702231\" width=612 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2127470/extras/d2966187c4f291d2de4e473a301cd79a.webm?t=1783702231\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2127470/extras/d2966187c4f291d2de4e473a301cd79a.mp4?t=1783702231\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet silly characters and unravel the story about the world, and about Axel's past. What kind of mystery is behind The Sandstorm? What happened to Axel?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BUILD OIL EXTRACTION CAMPS!</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2127470/extras/bf0d72e81a5e03705ae32613ad74f879.poster.avif?t=1783702231\" width=612 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2127470/extras/bf0d72e81a5e03705ae32613ad74f879.webm?t=1783702231\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2127470/extras/bf0d72e81a5e03705ae32613ad74f879.mp4?t=1783702231\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build oil extraction camps for gathering and defending the main resource in the game, oil. Fortify them with defensive structures, static weapons, and defenders, in order to fend off Vulture attacks!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DESTROY THE ENVIRONMENT!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2127470/extras/5681342ce469d32be5dd8932b25f4dab.poster.avif?t=1783702231\" width=612 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2127470/extras/5681342ce469d32be5dd8932b25f4dab.webm?t=1783702231\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2127470/extras/5681342ce469d32be5dd8932b25f4dab.mp4?t=1783702231\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lost in the Sand features structures with physics-based destruction that you can use to your tactical advantage. Either you use it to create improvised escape routes, demolish enemy's defensive structures or simply blow up stuff for fun. You are not safe anywhere on the map!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CRAFT EQUIPMENT AND VEHICLES!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2127470/extras/105101842bb6e1b85bb6c112430e49c8.poster.avif?t=1783702231\" width=612 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2127470/extras/105101842bb6e1b85bb6c112430e49c8.webm?t=1783702231\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2127470/extras/105101842bb6e1b85bb6c112430e49c8.mp4?t=1783702231\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >  </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft equipment such as weapons and armor in order to gain an advantage over your opponent. Assemble vehicles and upgrade them with armo