li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Limb strength (Makes individual limbs behave clumsier)  </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Morale (Makes them use more offensive or defensive tactics)   </p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ENHANCE YOUR PERFORMANCE!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2127470/extras/b2d606aa50ebde142df7813a5534c11f.avif?t=1783702231\" width=616 height=180 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take very suspicious substances made by The Cook in order to enhance your combat capabilities. Some improve your aim, some make you more durable, some make you bleed less, but all of them give you side effects.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURE LIST:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story &amp; characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crafting weapons, armor, ammo</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Building oil extraction camps</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Destruction system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vehicles crafting, driving and upgrading</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Army commanding</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trading with NPCs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Active ragdolls (Injury reaction system)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Procedurally generated worlds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stimulants</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Slow-paced shooter with strategy elements set in a procedural, fully destructible, post-apocalyptic world. Craft and fight with DIY weapons, build and demolish oil camps, meet silly characters, manage and upgrade your army, in order to beat The Vultures and discover what's behind The Sandstorm.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstati